package cfloat

// SPEC §5.1 row 10 on the packet Write: a compressed float that is NaN, an
// infinity, or finite and outside [min, max] is checked before quantizing, by
// the leg's mechanism (a debug assert in an assert leg, a refusal in every
// build elsewhere). cases.txt beside this file lists the values and verdicts.

type CFloat
{
    x float32 | min = 0.0, max = 10.0, resolution = 0.01
}
